# Architecture Context

Read the file `archyl.txt` at the root of this project before implementing any feature.
It contains the C4 architecture model, conformance rules, approved technologies, and API contracts.

## Guidelines

- Respect the architecture boundaries defined in archyl.txt.
- Do not create direct dependencies between services that are not documented.
- Use approved technologies only (see Technology Stack section in archyl.txt).
- All new API endpoints must follow existing API contract patterns.
- Async communication must use documented event channels.
